WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.267
-After the first weekend
of March Madness,

00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:03.601
there are no more
perfect brackets.

00:00:03.601 --> 00:00:05.033
Yeah.

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:08.267
Thanks to all the upsates -- the
upsets, everyone's bracket was

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:09.934
busted,
which isn't surprising.

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:11.834
The chances of having
a perfect bracket are one

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:14.100
in nine quintillion.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.901
In fact, the whole thing
inspired me to write

00:00:15.901 --> 00:00:16.968
a tiny song.

00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:18.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.634 --> 00:00:25.133
♪♪

00:01:19.434 --> 00:01:21.133
We have a great show!

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:24.000
Florence Pugh is here tonight.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.601
Gaten Matarazzo is joining us.

00:01:26.601 --> 00:01:29.901
And we've got music from
Talib Kweli and Madlib.

00:01:29.901 --> 00:01:32.767
Stick around. We'll be
right back with Florence Pugh.

00:01:32.767 --> 00:01:35.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:35.767 --> 00:01:38.968
♪♪

